# Composables & state

## useState keys (do not invent new globals without need)

| Key | Owner / writer | Purpose |
|-----|----------------|---------|
| `club` | `[clubname].vue` + `useUpdateClubData` | Current club |
| `clubPermissions` | `useClubPermissions` | Rights for current club |
| `lastGathering` | gathering `item[[id]].vue` | Post-create payload |
| `lastGatheringName` | same | Display name after create |

- Read club via `useState<Club>('club')`; do not refetch ad hoc if parent already loaded it.
- Permissions: `useClubPermissions().update()`, `useGetGlobalPermissions()` for `/admin`.
- Guest mapping: `useCurrentUserAsGuest()`.
- Default post-login club route: `useDefaultPage()` (currently club `terra`).
- No Pinia. Cookies: `theme`, `sb-redirect-path`. localStorage: `gatherings-view`.
